- Re-read every changed path from reos-development; confirm the expected content/blob SHA.
- Record commit URL, changed files, verification result, and any test result in REOS_CONTROL_CENTER/PS Output.
- Do not call a part complete if verification or evidence recording failed.
Completion evidence: Remote commit and file match the intended change; PS Output describes the actual verified result.
